-- ============================================================
-- ModzVerse — Worker Field Normalization (v1.2.0 patch)
-- 
-- PWS expects categorical labels for several worker fields,
-- but our SQL files stored numeric or non-canonical values.
-- This patch normalizes all 335 workers to use PWS-expected
-- values for: height, weight, race, build, drive.
-- 
-- Re-runnable: idempotent (UPDATEs are no-ops on already-
-- normalized rows because the WHERE clauses won't match).
-- ============================================================

